<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '60px' }}>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#193B5B', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>反方论点（≥5 条，含时间维度）</Text>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '1px', background: '#E7ECF0', marginTop: 12, marginBottom: 22 }} />

  <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', padding: '12px 0', borderBottom: '1px solid #E7ECF0' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#193B5B', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 44 }}>01</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#242D36', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>铝价受宏观加息预期压制，若利率上行则估值承压（时间维度）。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', padding: '12px 0', borderBottom: '1px solid #E7ECF0' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#193B5B', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 44 }}>02</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#242D36', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>地产链需求若持续走弱，加工费将再下探，量增价跌或转为量价齐跌。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', padding: '12px 0', borderBottom: '1px solid #E7ECF0' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#193B5B', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 44 }}>03</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#242D36', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>进口铝土矿集中度过高，地缘扰动可能推升原料成本、挤压吨利。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', padding: '12px 0', borderBottom: '1px solid #E7ECF0' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#193B5B', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 44 }}>04</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#242D36', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>绿电铝产能集中释放，或压制现货溢价与吨利，削弱景气弹性。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', padding: '12px 0', borderBottom: '1px solid #E7ECF0' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#193B5B', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 44 }}>05</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#242D36', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>板块估值已部分反映复苏预期，安全边际相对收窄。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', padding: '12px 0' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#193B5B', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 44 }}>06</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#242D36', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>下游新能源需求增速若见顶，量增逻辑存在证伪风险。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
